<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Transocean raised long-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Transocean raised long-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it the long-term rating of Transocean Offshore Inc to buy from accumulate on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company's near-term rating was kept at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 56-1/8 on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Kevin Simpson was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
